# The Worker needs NO secrets. It is a pure image proxy backed by the
# Cloudflare edge cache — there is no object-storage tier and nothing to
# authenticate against.
#
# All configuration lives in wrangler.toml [vars] (ALLOWED_SOURCE_HOSTS,
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS), which are non-secret. `wrangler dev` therefore needs no
# `.dev.vars` file at all; this example is kept only to document that.
